### List fleets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/fleets

### Get aerial fleet
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/fleets/aerial

### Get aerial live objects in Tehran bbox
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/fleets/aerial/live-state?bbox=51.20,35.60,51.60,35.85

### Get BRT live objects in Tehran bbox
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/fleets/brt/live-state?bbox=51.20,35.60,51.60,35.85

### Get motorcycle live objects in Tehran bbox
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/fleets/motorcycle/live-state?bbox=51.20,35.60,51.60,35.85

### Replace {objectId} with an object id returned by a live-state request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/fleets/aerial/objects/{objectId}

### Get trajectory
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/fleets/aerial/objects/{objectId}/trajectory

### Conditional object request after receiving ETag
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/fleets/aerial/objects/{objectId}
If-None-Match: "42"
